@startuml
' Figure 35.2  Spans for one refund
' Reading order: top to bottom, case R-0002 in the lab, eight steps.
' Each arrow from the harness is a span: model calls (drawn on the
' harness itself), reads, the policy decision with the desk's
' approval, the refund through the gateway, the reconciler's check,
' and the notice.
' From trace.demo --part spans.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
participant "Harness" as H <<model>>
participant "Gateway" as G <<ops>>
participant "Policy" as P <<policy>>
participant "Verifier" as V <<verified>>
H -> H : Model calls,\nsteps 1 to 6
H -> G : Four reads
H -> P : Refund $450.10?
P --> H : Permit
H -> G : refund_ticket
G --> H : ok
H -> V : Check
V --> H : Match
H -> G : Notify
@enduml
